Whale Guidance Lite is an independent lightweight edition derived from Odysseia-Guidance.
The finite Bot dialogue and administrator manual-control modules are adapted from
the user's existing Odysseia-Guidance deployment. The parent project is licensed
under AGPL-3.0; this edition retains that license and attribution.
MaiBot's selective group participation and short conversational style informed
the design. No MaiBot runtime code or dependencies are bundled.
The whale persona is an original community-inspired interpretation; it is not an
official DeepSeek identity. The thirty-six emotes were generated using built-in
imagegen with a character reference supplied by the user. The original reference
artwork is not bundled. Generation specifications accompany the emote assets.
